[00:01.44]Lately
{"最近"}
[00:03.65]I can’t even think straight
{"我甚至无法清醒思考"}
[00:07.56]Memories trashing my brain
{"回忆在脑海中翻腾"}
[00:08.76]Just hoping
{"只是希望"}
[00:11.36]You’re still thinking of me
{"你仍在想着我"}
[00:14.65]You know what we could’ve been
{"你明白我们本可以怎样"}
[00:17.34]We turned the tv down so we could talk
{"我们调低电视音量只为交谈"}
[00:21.77]But we spent the whole night staring at the floor
{"却整夜盯着地板沉默"}
[00:25.89]I took my things out of the bottom drawer
{"我从底层抽屉取出所有物品"}
[00:29.84]And just walked
{"然后转身离开"}
[00:35.14]That was our final straw
{"那是我们最后的底线"}
[00:38.39]We could have had it all
{"我们本可以拥有一切"}
[00:40.61]This is our curtain call
{"这是我们的谢幕时刻"}
